{"author":{"id":"038d65070aa747b6bc9d50939fa697ec871a40ed259db54429b255bbef2581d6"},"ops":[{"type":1,"timestamp":1792866603,"nonce":"XknMbmkg3jPFKPNIU8mp/LqXpCU=","title":"Follow host tabs with independent editable documents and view-only previews","message":"Parent: 455de32231e2b4a39765b4dff0223570b525ccec145049431e6483f5aa521f98\nRelated: 34788515484d49c76e3d7a85cb8a07c25e4f630d9f4a219075e1f6c780ecd7c1\n\nThe local Jam currently binds one CRDT and invitation to one file. The user wants the live session to follow the host's active tab: editable code and view-only previews. Switching tabs must preserve each document's pending edits, collaborative undo and recovery; it must not replace one shared string with another file's contents or close/restart rooms on each switch.\n\nImplement a bounded, opt-in workspace protocol over one existing asynchronous session/worker. Keep legacy document sessions working. Only the authenticated host can publish documents or choose the active surface; do not infer host ownership from a peer ID visible to guests. Route edits, presence and acknowledgements by document ID. Keep per-document recovery and a checksummed manifest; replay documents and active surface after reconnect. Preview frames are bounded, ephemeral, and coalesced separately from ordered edits. Guests must never execute a host's extension UI.\n\nUI integration must use feature contributions and avoid Workbench-specific Jam hooks. Another session is currently refactoring JamFeature, Host, Features and Contributions, so transport work and focused tests proceed independently until that refactor is ready.\n\nValidation: two or more independently editable documents, edits arriving during host tab changes, independent author undo, Unicode presence routing, late join/reconnect and disk recovery, host authentication including forged peer IDs, malformed/path-traversal/oversized payload rejection, bounded latest-frame delivery without losing edits, legacy Jam tests, then editor checks and a second participant when the NUC is idle.","files":null}]}